div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e0e7ff;padding:10px;background:linear-gradient(to right,#f8fafc,#f5f3ff);margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#ede9fe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Attribute Name</div></div><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;\">customer_age</div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e0e7ff;padding:10px;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#ede9fe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M14 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h4\"/><path d=\"M17 21H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"9\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"17\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Description</div></div><div style=\"border-top:1px dotted #cbd5e1;margin:6px 0;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#475569;line-height:1.8;\">Usia pelanggan yang tercatat berdasarkan data KYC di sistem core banking. Nilai berupa angka bulat dalam satuan tahun.</div></div></div></div>"
